WEBVTT

﻿1

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.320
You gave it to me to use it.


00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.422
Only in case of emergency.


00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:33.625
And you used it at a bar! With who?


00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:37.629
So annoying! Don't be so petty.


00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.630
What the heck.


00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:39.932
Come on, sweetie.


00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:43.302
Let go! Let go of me!
Let's have fun.


00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.003
Let go of me!


00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:49.608
Eun-hye! Are you okay?


00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:52.911
Sweetie, you heard it too, right?


00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:57.216
I've had it! I can't live here anymore!


00:01:57.217 --> 00:02:00.018
I got no money to move!


00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:04.523
You said you'll help me move.


00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:07.626
Forget it. Drop it.


00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:11.620
Eun-hye!
Just drop it!


00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:33.111
God darn it!


00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:52.631
You know that next door's jerk?


00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:57.002
Yeah, that jerk, I bumped into him again.


00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:58.994
Sporting a helmet no less.


00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:09.014
2 days ago, he was meandering near my door.


00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:14.219
You know what, I lost
my keys the other day.


00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:17.522
So I called the locksmith.


00:04:17.523 --> 00:04:22.227
Shouldn't he ask for my ID or something?


00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:28.895
He just opened it, and
that jerk was peeping.


00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:31.397
One sec.


00:04:56.229 --> 00:04:58.730
Come out!


00:04:58.731 --> 00:05:00.892
Open this god darn door!


00:05:03.703 --> 00:05:05.904
You scumbag!


00:05:05.905 --> 00:05:08.607
You thought I wouldn't find out?


00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:11.510
Too bad for you, I recorded everything!


00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:15.504
I'm gonna call the cops,
you're finished now!


00:05:23.022 --> 00:05:27.015
You're finished.


00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:34.318
What are you doing there?


00:06:36.129 --> 00:06:39.831
Where do you live? Where's mom?


00:06:39.832 --> 00:06:43.791
It's past your bedtime.


00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:04.413
Scared that I'm gonna call the cops?


00:08:22.001 --> 00:08:24.503
There's a weird rumor


00:08:24.504 --> 00:08:28.106
going around in my neighborhood.


00:08:28.107 --> 00:08:32.110
It's about squatters
hiding in others' homes,


00:08:32.111 --> 00:08:38.209
and secretly living there.


00:08:41.621 --> 00:08:49.621
"HIDE AND SEEK"


00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:56.201
Where could they be?


00:08:56.202 --> 00:09:02.407
Hide well, I'll find you.


00:09:02.408 --> 00:09:04.501
Here I come!


00:09:07.513 --> 00:09:12.314
Where could they be? Near the bed?


00:09:17.823 --> 00:09:20.917
Got you, I found you.


00:09:31.103 --> 00:09:34.402
Let's get Ho-seh.


00:09:36.809 --> 00:09:40.802
Go! you!
We go! you!


00:10:04.804 --> 00:10:08.399
He's here again.


00:10:13.813 --> 00:10:16.014
Does he come by often?


00:10:16.015 --> 00:10:22.320
Don't even mention it,
always blabbering on.


00:10:22.321 --> 00:10:26.024
He doesn't look sane.


00:10:26.025 --> 00:10:28.326
Why here of all the places?


00:10:28.327 --> 00:10:29.928
Did he ever come inside?


00:10:29.929 --> 00:10:34.399
Not so far, but who knows.


00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:38.393
Boss, shouldn't we report him?


00:11:36.028 --> 00:11:37.729
You know what, mom?


00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.630
Mom!
Yeah?


00:12:03.022 --> 00:12:06.124
Honey.


00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:09.427
Did you take the pills?


00:12:09.428 --> 00:12:13.387
Tell me if it gets too hard.


00:12:15.401 --> 00:12:21.106
Dad, Ho-seh is being mean.


00:12:21.107 --> 00:12:22.607
Ho-seh, apologize.


00:12:22.608 --> 00:12:25.210
No, she started it!


00:12:25.211 --> 00:12:26.711
I did not!


00:12:26.712 --> 00:12:28.813
Liar! You teased first!


00:12:28.814 --> 00:12:30.515
I didn't!


00:12:30.516 --> 00:12:31.916
Stop! Stop it.


00:12:31.917 --> 00:12:35.220
Hello...


00:12:35.221 --> 00:12:38.923
I'm so sorry, could you repeat that?


00:12:38.924 --> 00:12:43.328
Do you know Mr. Baek Sung-chul?


00:12:43.329 --> 00:12:48.600
<i>Excuse me?
Mr. Baek Sung-chul.</i>


00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:51.402
Hello?


00:12:51.403 --> 00:12:55.306
Yes.
Do you know him?


00:12:55.307 --> 00:12:58.309
Who is this? How do you know him?


00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:02.303
So you do?


00:13:05.818 --> 00:13:08.119
What's this about?


00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:13.820
I could be wrong, but I think he's missing.


00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:20.995
"Baek Sung-chul: No subject"


00:13:23.702 --> 00:13:29.207
I heard you moved. Still no words from you.


00:13:29.208 --> 00:13:32.200
There's something I need to hear from you.


00:13:57.002 --> 00:14:02.099
It's your new brother, Sung-soc, say hi.


00:14:07.813 --> 00:14:11.115
I heard you got married in USA.


00:14:11.116 --> 00:14:14.018
Two kids, I heard.


00:14:14.019 --> 00:14:20.525
I can't reach anyone after mom died.


00:14:20.526 --> 00:14:23.428
It's so hard and lonely.


00:14:23.429 --> 00:14:27.599
I'll be kicked out of my place soon.


00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:31.502
There's nowhere else to go.


00:14:31.503 --> 00:14:36.307
Let's meet. Tell me your address.


00:14:36.308 --> 00:14:41.302
I want to ask you something.


00:15:52.718 --> 00:15:54.015
Sung-chul!


00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.094
"Our loving parents, Baek
Ki-chul, Kim Soon-hee"


00:16:10.402 --> 00:16:12.904
Has...


00:16:12.905 --> 00:16:17.909
<i>Sung-chul ever been here?</i>


00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.903
Sung-chul? Why'd he?


00:16:27.519 --> 00:16:31.512
He has no right to come here.


00:16:34.026 --> 00:16:37.628
To this day, whenever his name comes up,


00:16:37.629 --> 00:16:40.498
my dad shivers in rage.


00:16:40.499 --> 00:16:44.402
I manage Mr. Baek's apartment.


00:16:44.403 --> 00:16:49.207
It's been months since
I last talked to him.


00:16:49.208 --> 00:16:53.111
I found your number in his room.


00:16:53.112 --> 00:16:57.515
Could you come and pick up his belongings?


00:16:57.516 --> 00:17:02.120
Who's Sung-chul?


00:17:02.121 --> 00:17:04.419
Honey!


00:18:04.216 --> 00:18:07.218
When did he move here?


00:18:07.219 --> 00:18:12.223
After he was released,
so about 2 years ago.


00:18:12.224 --> 00:18:15.125
You know he went to jail, right?


00:18:31.009 --> 00:18:34.112
Could something have happened to him?


00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:38.316
I wouldn't worry too much.


00:18:38.317 --> 00:18:42.820
It's a common incident around here.


00:18:42.821 --> 00:18:47.425
Since it's near a harbor,
there are many illegal aliens


00:18:47.426 --> 00:18:52.130
who live here briefly, and ﬂee the country.


00:18:52.131 --> 00:18:59.303
With unpaid rents, this
place getting demolished,


00:18:59.304 --> 00:19:02.707
he probably took off.


00:19:02.708 --> 00:19:06.701
I'll be downstairs, let me know.


00:20:42.908 --> 00:20:46.010
He didn't have a co-signer, why?


00:20:46.011 --> 00:20:52.917
It looked like he lived with someone.


00:20:52.918 --> 00:20:55.113
I seriously doubt it.


00:20:56.622 --> 00:20:58.723
317?


00:20:58.724 --> 00:21:00.524
Yes.


00:21:00.525 --> 00:21:02.927
Did something happen?


00:21:02.928 --> 00:21:06.130
Do you know the man who lives there?


00:21:06.131 --> 00:21:08.499
I'm not sure.


00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.201
Who's that?


00:21:10.202 --> 00:21:12.102
Sorry, I'm a bit busy.


00:21:24.516 --> 00:21:26.217
Speak louder!


00:21:26.218 --> 00:21:28.719
That apartment there! The resident!


00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:31.622
I don't know!


00:21:31.623 --> 00:21:35.616
Madam!


00:22:06.224 --> 00:22:11.529
Dad's not home. He said not
to open for strangers.


00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:13.597
Hold on.


00:22:13.598 --> 00:22:17.201
You don't live with mom?


00:22:17.202 --> 00:22:24.108
She died a few years ago. How did you know?


00:22:33.118 --> 00:22:36.120
414, 2 men.


00:22:36.121 --> 00:22:40.124
415,1 man, 1 woman, 2 kids.


00:22:40.125 --> 00:22:44.118
416, 2 women.


00:22:51.903 --> 00:22:55.896
317,1 man.


00:22:57.809 --> 00:23:00.911
And...


00:23:00.912 --> 00:23:05.416
I'm his wife, how could he hide that?


00:23:05.417 --> 00:23:07.418
What do I do? I'm at a loss.


00:23:07.419 --> 00:23:10.221
Mom! Can I play there?


00:23:10.222 --> 00:23:13.524
Can't you see I'm speaking
with grandma in America?


00:23:13.525 --> 00:23:15.726
I wanna play games.


00:23:15.727 --> 00:23:17.628
Yeah! Me too!


00:23:17.629 --> 00:23:20.798
Mom, one sec.


00:23:20.799 --> 00:23:22.199
All right, go play.


00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:23.801
Okay.
Take care of Su-ah.


00:23:23.802 --> 00:23:27.004
Got it.
Su-ah! Hold your brother's hand!


00:23:27.005 --> 00:23:29.098
Okay!


00:23:37.616 --> 00:23:40.317
Now?


00:23:40.318 --> 00:23:42.420
We're at his brother's place.


00:23:42.421 --> 00:23:46.414
Yeah.


00:23:50.729 --> 00:23:53.789
That's what I said.


00:24:11.016 --> 00:24:15.219
It looked like he had
some serious problems.


00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:19.623
He ran away in high school,
and not a word since.


00:24:19.624 --> 00:24:21.615
Yeah.


00:24:31.102 --> 00:24:35.095
I'll call you back!


00:24:46.218 --> 00:24:49.920
Hey, kiddo.


00:24:49.921 --> 00:24:55.018
Did you see the kids you were playing with?


00:24:56.728 --> 00:25:00.698
Pyung-hwa!


00:25:00.699 --> 00:25:04.692
I'm sorry, I was looking for my kids.


00:25:17.115 --> 00:25:21.108
Ho-seh!


00:25:26.324 --> 00:25:28.622
<i>Ho-seh...</i>


00:25:33.031 --> 00:25:35.898
Ho-seh!


00:26:12.404 --> 00:26:13.404
<i>Mom...</i>


00:26:13.405 --> 00:26:15.606
Ho-seh!
Mom...


00:26:15.607 --> 00:26:19.209
Excuse me, what are you doing?


00:26:19.210 --> 00:26:24.114
Get out of there...


00:26:24.115 --> 00:26:25.115
Mom!


00:26:25.116 --> 00:26:28.719
Ho-seh... open this door!


00:26:28.720 --> 00:26:30.921
Open the door and get out!


00:26:30.922 --> 00:26:34.915
Open this darn door! Get out!


00:26:37.929 --> 00:26:41.498
Get out!


00:26:41.499 --> 00:26:43.701
Come out of there.


00:26:43.702 --> 00:26:44.202
Huff)"


00:26:48.306 --> 00:26:50.908
Now, hurry!


00:26:50.909 --> 00:26:54.003
Go... go away!


00:26:56.615 --> 00:27:00.017
Mom...
You okay?


00:27:00.018 --> 00:27:04.011
What happened? You okay?


00:27:07.225 --> 00:27:11.218
Are you all right, madam?


00:27:26.411 --> 00:27:27.811
Madam.


00:27:27.812 --> 00:27:31.815
You must be startled,
this place is like that.


00:27:31.816 --> 00:27:35.819
I can never leave my kid alone.


00:27:35.820 --> 00:27:37.921
Thank you so much, but you don't have to...


00:27:37.922 --> 00:27:41.225
It's nothing, please come in for some tea.


00:27:41.226 --> 00:27:45.229
I barely have anyone to talk to here.


00:27:45.230 --> 00:27:48.999
Your coat is so pretty,
where did you get it?


00:27:49.000 --> 00:27:52.993
Please come in.


00:28:05.016 --> 00:28:07.918
Come in.


00:28:07.919 --> 00:28:09.720
A bit shabby, isn't it?


00:28:09.721 --> 00:28:14.224
But this is the biggest in the complex.


00:28:14.225 --> 00:28:15.826
Please sit down.


00:28:15.827 --> 00:28:19.820
Would you like some coffee?


00:28:21.599 --> 00:28:25.402
2 apartments were combined into 1.


00:28:25.403 --> 00:28:29.707
That's why it's bigger than others.


00:28:29.708 --> 00:28:33.010
It's got a great view too.


00:28:33.011 --> 00:28:36.814
We recently moved from
a small place nearby.


00:28:36.815 --> 00:28:40.808
We couldn't live a day longer.


00:28:47.225 --> 00:28:51.218
Hi, my name is Pyung-hwa. What's your name?


00:28:57.402 --> 00:29:00.003
Her pronunciation's great.


00:29:00.004 --> 00:29:03.907
My hubby is in Australia now.


00:29:03.908 --> 00:29:07.411
We'll be leaving for it soon.


00:29:07.412 --> 00:29:11.915
Her age is perfect for
picking up new languages.


00:29:11.916 --> 00:29:15.219
Wanna see the doll?


00:29:15.220 --> 00:29:16.920
Su-ah, let her play with it.


00:29:16.921 --> 00:29:21.325
No, she's dirty, I hate it here!


00:29:21.326 --> 00:29:24.828
Su-ah. Where're your manners?


00:29:24.829 --> 00:29:26.990
Want a time out?


00:29:39.010 --> 00:29:42.412
She's Pyung-hwa, it means 'Peace'.


00:29:42.413 --> 00:29:46.406
Pretty name.


00:29:48.820 --> 00:29:52.523
I'm worried, she'll have
to attend school soon.


00:29:52.524 --> 00:29:57.027
It's so dangerous here.


00:29:57.028 --> 00:30:01.598
Your car looked very expensive.


00:30:01.599 --> 00:30:03.300
It's really not...


00:30:03.301 --> 00:30:06.203
You must be from Seoul,


00:30:06.204 --> 00:30:09.306
what brings you to our shabby place?


00:30:09.307 --> 00:30:12.209
It's not shabby at all, it's really cozy.


00:30:12.210 --> 00:30:15.612
You got any juicy info?


00:30:15.613 --> 00:30:20.017
What?
When will they start demolishing?


00:30:20.018 --> 00:30:22.319
I heard it could be this month.


00:30:22.320 --> 00:30:26.123
We never get to settle into our new home.


00:30:26.124 --> 00:30:27.424
It's nothing like that.


00:30:27.425 --> 00:30:31.128
Please give me a heads up.


00:30:31.129 --> 00:30:35.088
I was planning to move to a better place.


00:30:38.603 --> 00:30:44.708
Actually, my brother lives here.


00:30:44.709 --> 00:30:47.611
Is that so? Which one?


00:30:47.612 --> 00:30:49.313
Nearby.


00:30:49.314 --> 00:30:50.914
Seriously?


00:30:50.915 --> 00:30:54.908
<i>Yes. It's 317.</i>


00:30:58.022 --> 00:31:00.424
Are you...


00:31:00.425 --> 00:31:02.426
Leave.
Sorry?


00:31:02.427 --> 00:31:06.330
Get out! Get out of my house!


00:31:06.331 --> 00:31:08.198
Madam, what's wrong?


00:31:08.199 --> 00:31:09.499
Mom!
Like you don't know?


00:31:09.500 --> 00:31:12.502
Perverts like him should
be locked up for good.


00:31:12.503 --> 00:31:14.805
How can I raise my kid with him around?


00:31:14.806 --> 00:31:16.106
Do you know anything about him?


00:31:16.107 --> 00:31:20.100
Forget it! I don't want to hear it!
Get out!


00:31:24.115 --> 00:31:28.108
Please!


00:31:30.922 --> 00:31:35.723
Please get him to stop peeping at my child.


00:31:36.828 --> 00:31:37.828
What?


00:31:37.829 --> 00:31:40.297
Please stop him!


00:31:40.298 --> 00:31:43.400
I can't sleep at night because of him.


00:31:43.401 --> 00:31:44.801
He's driving me crazy!


00:31:44.802 --> 00:31:46.103
I don't know what...


00:31:46.104 --> 00:31:50.097
I'm losing my mind!


00:31:52.710 --> 00:31:55.812
This is way too much to handle!


00:31:55.813 --> 00:31:59.616
What's going on? What did your brother do?


00:31:59.617 --> 00:32:02.920
Honey!


00:32:02.921 --> 00:32:05.222
Are you all right?


00:32:05.223 --> 00:32:06.523
What?


00:32:06.524 --> 00:32:10.517
Why not call some people to clean it up?


00:32:13.131 --> 00:32:14.996
Honey!


00:32:18.102 --> 00:32:20.504
Head home with the kids.


00:32:20.505 --> 00:32:25.602
I'm sorry. I want to
look into it a bit more.


00:32:39.424 --> 00:32:41.525
Su-ah, don't rub your eyes.


00:32:41.526 --> 00:32:45.128
Why?


00:32:45.129 --> 00:32:48.699
Just don't, you'll hurt your eyes.


00:32:48.700 --> 00:32:52.693
Let's go see a doctor tomorrow.


00:33:54.198 --> 00:33:57.099
Dad!


00:33:58.102 --> 00:34:00.404
My son!


00:34:00.405 --> 00:34:03.499
Did you wait long?


00:34:29.200 --> 00:34:34.404
Jae-min's dad bought him a 3DS last week.


00:34:34.405 --> 00:34:35.906
That's enough, lie down.


00:34:35.907 --> 00:34:37.707
<i>Mom...</i>


00:34:37.708 --> 00:34:38.809
Yes, honey?


00:34:38.810 --> 00:34:41.511
I want a yogurt.


00:34:41.512 --> 00:34:44.014
Your teeth will rot.


00:34:44.015 --> 00:34:45.515
Mom.
Yeah?


00:34:45.516 --> 00:34:51.221
That girl told me, there
are many empty houses,


00:34:51.222 --> 00:34:55.325
and beggars hide and live there.


00:34:55.326 --> 00:35:00.897
Sometimes living
with the family without permission.


00:35:00.898 --> 00:35:02.399
That's nonsense.


00:35:02.400 --> 00:35:07.895
That's what she said, hidden from everyone.


00:35:25.423 --> 00:35:28.824
Sung-chul?


00:38:52.229 --> 00:38:54.697
"Transfer of Inheritance Ownership"


00:39:01.105 --> 00:39:02.505
"It's not fair. No one believes me"


00:39:02.506 --> 00:39:04.007
"I have no one around me. So lonely"


00:39:04.008 --> 00:39:06.602
"He's not my brother, how
could do this again"


00:39:09.113 --> 00:39:13.106
"I loathed father. I wanted him to die"


00:39:19.523 --> 00:39:25.328
Father, do not ignore me. I am not a ghost.


00:39:25.329 --> 00:39:28.098
I am well and alive.


00:39:28.099 --> 00:39:32.900
And I'll continue to live as best as I can.


00:39:35.206 --> 00:39:36.606
Goodbye.


00:39:36.607 --> 00:39:40.810
And one day, I'll show up before you.


00:39:40.811 --> 00:39:44.114
I am not a ghost.


00:39:44.115 --> 00:39:45.115
Are you hungry?


00:39:45.116 --> 00:39:46.116
Yeah!


00:39:46.117 --> 00:39:47.717
What should we eat for lunch?


00:39:47.718 --> 00:39:49.319
Pizza! I want pizza!


00:39:49.320 --> 00:39:53.313
Let's have it with dad and Ho-seh.


00:40:15.212 --> 00:40:17.013
The door is opening.


00:40:17.014 --> 00:40:20.711
Let's go.


00:40:36.300 --> 00:40:38.894
The door is opening.


00:41:25.816 --> 00:41:28.307
The elevator is closing.


00:41:36.627 --> 00:41:39.529
Mom, why's he carrying umbrella?


00:41:39.530 --> 00:41:41.896
Su-ah, quiet.


00:41:47.104 --> 00:41:48.696
8th ﬂoor.


00:41:50.608 --> 00:41:54.601
Pizza, let's get pizza!


00:42:10.728 --> 00:42:14.687
<i>Mom, 5880...</i>


00:42:25.609 --> 00:42:27.310
"New Passcode?"


00:42:27.311 --> 00:42:32.615
Mom, 3DS! You promised you'd buy me!


00:42:32.616 --> 00:42:34.417
When did I?


00:42:34.418 --> 00:42:37.120
You promised last week!


00:42:37.121 --> 00:42:39.222
When can I have yogurt?


00:42:39.223 --> 00:42:41.124
Ho-seh, remember what I said?


00:42:41.125 --> 00:42:44.227
Only if you study 2 hours a day.


00:42:44.228 --> 00:42:45.328
So did you or not?


00:42:45.329 --> 00:42:46.329
I did!


00:42:46.330 --> 00:42:48.698
Mom, when's yogurt time?


00:42:48.699 --> 00:42:53.903
I didn't see you study,
and yogurt lady's not here yet.


00:42:53.904 --> 00:42:56.906
I did! I really did!


00:42:56.907 --> 00:42:58.508
Mom!


00:42:58.509 --> 00:43:01.311
This is the front desk,
there's a package for you.


00:43:01.312 --> 00:43:04.304
Thank you.


00:43:07.618 --> 00:43:11.421
Welcome, please select from the menu.


00:43:11.422 --> 00:43:13.219
"Baek Sung-chul"


00:43:14.625 --> 00:43:18.618
Please take your bank book.


00:43:21.498 --> 00:43:23.193
Dongbu Mart.


00:43:30.908 --> 00:43:34.310
Hello, I'm here for 805 package.


00:43:34.311 --> 00:43:37.013
Right, one moment.


00:43:37.014 --> 00:43:38.314
Here's the package.


00:43:38.315 --> 00:43:41.307
Thank you.


00:43:51.629 --> 00:43:52.629
Hello?


00:43:52.630 --> 00:43:53.796
Min-jig


00:43:53.797 --> 00:43:56.699
Honey?


00:43:56.700 --> 00:43:57.800
Did you lose your phone?


00:43:57.801 --> 00:43:59.202
Where are you now? Home?


00:43:59.203 --> 00:44:02.705
Now? I'm downstairs for a package.


00:44:02.706 --> 00:44:04.407
Get back home! Right away!


00:44:04.408 --> 00:44:05.608
What's wrong?


00:44:05.609 --> 00:44:08.811
Get home and don't let
anyone in until I get there!


00:44:08.812 --> 00:44:10.313
Got it?


00:44:10.314 --> 00:44:14.307
What's going on?
Hurry!


00:44:27.598 --> 00:44:29.098
I'm heading up now.


00:44:29.099 --> 00:44:31.901
When do I get yogurt?


00:44:31.902 --> 00:44:35.204
Su-ah, will you stop that?


00:44:35.205 --> 00:44:37.807
But she's waiting.


00:44:37.808 --> 00:44:42.912
What?
The yogurt lady is waiting outside.


00:44:42.913 --> 00:44:45.214
Can't I let her in?


00:44:45.215 --> 00:44:47.517
Su-ah, don't open the door!


00:44:47.518 --> 00:44:51.521
Wait for me, okay?


00:44:51.522 --> 00:44:53.122
It's not the yogurt lady!


00:44:53.123 --> 00:44:57.116
Don't open the door! Just wait for me!


00:45:09.006 --> 00:45:13.710
Hello... Su-ah!


00:45:13.711 --> 00:45:17.013
Mom, she's knocking.


00:45:17.014 --> 00:45:19.415
Is the door locked?


00:45:19.416 --> 00:45:22.112
Yeah.
Okay, stay quiet.


00:45:34.998 --> 00:45:36.795
Incorrect passcode.


00:45:38.802 --> 00:45:42.795
Incorrect passcode.


00:46:14.705 --> 00:46:18.808
Kids, are you okay? Hello...


00:46:18.809 --> 00:46:22.311
Mom! I think she's gone.


00:46:22.312 --> 00:46:24.914
Yeah?
Should I check?


00:46:24.915 --> 00:46:27.611
No! Don't open the door!


00:47:08.725 --> 00:47:11.928
Ho-seh, it's mom! It's all right.


00:47:11.929 --> 00:47:15.194
Mom!
You okay?


00:47:22.406 --> 00:47:24.407
Mom!


00:47:24.408 --> 00:47:30.112
Help! Please help us!


00:47:30.113 --> 00:47:32.915
Someone help!


00:47:32.916 --> 00:47:36.909
<i>Mom...</i>


00:47:38.322 --> 00:47:42.315
Everything okay?


00:47:57.908 --> 00:48:02.411
I'm sorry, we'll check the CCTV
and take necessary action.


00:48:02.412 --> 00:48:06.405
I'm sorry again.


00:48:13.824 --> 00:48:19.128
His face is not visible,
so we can't be sure.


00:48:19.129 --> 00:48:21.597
It could be a nut job,


00:48:21.598 --> 00:48:26.202
or someone targeted your home specifically.


00:48:26.203 --> 00:48:30.506
And like you said, it
could be Baek Sung-chul.


00:48:30.507 --> 00:48:34.911
3 prior convictions,
including sexual assault.


00:48:34.912 --> 00:48:38.214
Find out if he is on the wanted list.


00:48:38.215 --> 00:48:39.515
Yes, sir.
Check his whereabouts.


00:48:39.516 --> 00:48:41.108
Got it.


00:49:01.004 --> 00:49:04.997
It's his most recent photo.


00:49:08.412 --> 00:49:12.615
Yes, we consulted on these.


00:49:12.616 --> 00:49:15.217
Was it February of 2011?


00:49:15.218 --> 00:49:18.821
He came in with a document.


00:49:18.822 --> 00:49:20.022
A document?


00:49:20.023 --> 00:49:22.625
It was a will, your father's.


00:49:22.626 --> 00:49:24.527
And he also asked something,


00:49:24.528 --> 00:49:28.487
"Proof of Family Relations" whether
he has ownership over his apartment.


00:49:30.500 --> 00:49:32.802
If I remember correctly,


00:49:32.803 --> 00:49:39.308
he was the birth child,
and you were adopted.


00:49:39.309 --> 00:49:43.312
Here it is, at Pyeongtaek
orphanage till <i>7,</i> right?


00:49:43.313 --> 00:49:46.805
It looked like he felt
wronged for something.


00:49:48.618 --> 00:49:51.020
I wouldn't blame all on him,


00:49:51.021 --> 00:49:54.523
your father did leave everything to you,


00:49:54.524 --> 00:49:58.517
that's a bit extreme.


00:49:59.629 --> 00:50:01.197
Are you okay?


00:50:01.198 --> 00:50:03.899
By the way, I received an SMS.


00:50:03.900 --> 00:50:07.103
That he can't be reached for a while.


00:50:07.104 --> 00:50:09.902
It was a long time ago.


00:50:15.012 --> 00:50:23.012
Why did you do it? Why?


00:50:24.921 --> 00:50:25.737
Why me? Why?


00:50:41.605 --> 00:50:45.808
Did you really see it?


00:50:45.809 --> 00:50:50.312
It's okay.
Jerk, how dare you touch my daughter?


00:50:50.313 --> 00:50:53.315
Suns-soc, right?


00:50:53.316 --> 00:50:56.118
It's all right, tell me.


00:50:56.119 --> 00:50:58.421
You can tell me, what happened?


00:50:58.422 --> 00:51:03.025
Tell them, your brother didn't do anything!


00:51:03.026 --> 00:51:06.985
She's the one lying!


00:51:11.902 --> 00:51:14.603
You can tell me everything.


00:51:14.604 --> 00:51:18.597
Please save us from evil.


00:51:21.111 --> 00:51:23.612
It was...


00:51:23.613 --> 00:51:25.604
Go on.


00:51:31.922 --> 00:51:35.915
It was Sung-chul.


00:51:39.529 --> 00:51:41.394
It was him.


00:51:43.700 --> 00:51:44.200
Jerk...


00:51:51.208 --> 00:51:56.412
Why? Why did you say that? You're lying!


00:51:56.413 --> 00:51:59.315
Let go! Let go of me!


00:51:59.316 --> 00:52:03.309
I didn't do it! Stop lying!


00:52:13.396 --> 00:52:17.389
Mom, where's Ho-seh?


00:52:26.710 --> 00:52:30.703
8th ﬂoor.


00:53:10.520 --> 00:53:13.722
505,1 man, 1 woman, 1 child.


00:53:13.723 --> 00:53:16.825
404,1 man, 1 woman, 3 children.


00:53:16.826 --> 00:53:20.785
304, 1 woman, 1 child.


00:53:25.902 --> 00:53:29.895
204,1 man.


00:53:32.108 --> 00:53:34.910
Honey, Ho-seh's missing.


00:53:34.911 --> 00:53:35.911
Are you sure?


00:53:35.912 --> 00:53:40.916
I was at school, but he
supposedly left early.


00:53:40.917 --> 00:53:43.519
He's not home either, what do I do?


00:53:43.520 --> 00:53:44.620
Have you called him?


00:53:44.621 --> 00:53:47.923
He's not answering.


00:53:47.924 --> 00:53:50.926
Honey, stay calm, I'm sure it's nothing.


00:53:50.927 --> 00:53:54.693
Your son is missing!


00:53:58.702 --> 00:54:02.004
Honey, I see him.


00:54:02.005 --> 00:54:04.303
Ho-seh, you mean?


00:54:26.029 --> 00:54:28.697
Get that guy.


00:54:28.698 --> 00:54:31.496
Grab him!


00:54:34.304 --> 00:54:37.102
Hey, mister!


00:54:48.318 --> 00:54:50.013
Slop!


00:55:16.313 --> 00:55:19.415
Who are you? Why are you after my kids?


00:55:19.416 --> 00:55:20.716
Who the heck are you?


00:55:20.717 --> 00:55:22.117
Madam, please calm down.


00:55:22.118 --> 00:55:23.517
How can I calm down?


00:55:27.223 --> 00:55:30.526
She asked me to wait downstairs.


00:55:30.527 --> 00:55:34.797
His story checks out.
No, stop lying to me.


00:55:34.798 --> 00:55:37.800
I know you're lying!


00:55:37.801 --> 00:55:38.617
Don't lie...


00:55:47.110 --> 00:55:49.812
What do you want from us? Stop lying!


00:55:49.813 --> 00:55:53.806
Madam...
One moment!


00:55:56.920 --> 00:55:59.521
You're going way overboard.


00:55:59.522 --> 00:56:00.723
What?


00:56:00.724 --> 00:56:04.326
We cooperated fully to
all of your requests.


00:56:04.327 --> 00:56:07.396
Should you at least not create a scene?


00:56:07.397 --> 00:56:10.299
What did you say?


00:56:10.300 --> 00:56:14.203
There weren't any incidents after that.


00:56:14.204 --> 00:56:15.904
The residents are becoming uneasy.


00:56:15.905 --> 00:56:17.506
What about the markings?


00:56:17.507 --> 00:56:20.809
What?


00:56:20.810 --> 00:56:24.713
There are markings below every doorbell.


00:56:24.714 --> 00:56:26.511
I do <i>not...</i>


00:56:51.808 --> 00:56:55.511
I'm so sorry, but could you leave
it at the security office?


00:56:55.512 --> 00:56:57.309
But I need recipient's signature.


00:58:27.403 --> 00:58:30.201
Why?


00:59:51.521 --> 00:59:54.022
Why did you do it?


00:59:54.023 --> 00:59:58.016
Why me? Why...


00:59:59.929 --> 01:00:07.301
Our heavenly Father, you
are our one true God.


01:00:22.819 --> 01:00:25.913
Honey!


01:00:33.696 --> 01:00:34.196
Honey!


01:00:37.700 --> 01:00:40.897
Mom!


01:00:41.904 --> 01:00:43.905
You jerk!


01:00:43.906 --> 01:00:45.707
What am I suppose to do now?


01:00:45.708 --> 01:00:50.512
What do you want from me? Tell me!


01:00:50.513 --> 01:00:53.315
What do you want, jerk?


01:00:53.316 --> 01:00:56.618
Please, stop!


01:00:56.619 --> 01:00:59.021
I've had enough!


01:00:59.022 --> 01:01:01.523
I can't live like this anymore!


01:01:01.524 --> 01:01:04.426
I'm taking the kids back to the States,


01:01:04.427 --> 01:01:08.386
do what you feel like!


01:01:41.197 --> 01:01:43.188
Wait, wait a moment.


01:01:45.702 --> 01:01:50.305
Just one moment. Have you seen my brother?


01:01:50.306 --> 01:01:52.399
He's still here, right?


01:01:57.413 --> 01:02:00.415
He's nearby.


01:02:00.416 --> 01:02:02.617
Where exactly?


01:02:02.618 --> 01:02:05.921
Very near, I'm begging you,


01:02:05.922 --> 01:02:10.825
please get him to stop peeping at us.


01:05:50.413 --> 01:05:52.314
Who are you?


01:05:52.315 --> 01:05:55.807
How do you know my brother? Where is he?


01:05:57.520 --> 01:06:00.722
Where is he?


01:06:00.723 --> 01:06:04.716
Eun-hye, where is she?


01:06:12.501 --> 01:06:17.205
Who's Eun-hye?


01:06:17.206 --> 01:06:20.107
Eun-hye...


01:06:21.610 --> 01:06:25.603
Are you Eun-hye's neighbor?


01:06:36.325 --> 01:06:39.327
Eun-hye?


01:06:39.328 --> 01:06:43.287
Yes, she's my girlfriend.


01:06:45.901 --> 01:06:51.305
Could she be missing by any chance?


01:06:53.609 --> 01:06:58.713
I couldn't reach her
suddenly a few months ago.


01:06:58.714 --> 01:07:06.121
We fought over men before,
but she was always reachable.


01:07:06.122 --> 01:07:11.026
And then I received a text message.


01:07:11.027 --> 01:07:13.795
It said she wouldn't be
reached for a while.


01:07:13.796 --> 01:07:20.602
Could I see that message?


01:07:20.603 --> 01:07:23.299
The text?


01:07:26.409 --> 01:07:26.909
Here.


01:07:30.513 --> 01:07:34.516
She flirts and hooks up with other men,


01:07:34.517 --> 01:07:36.918
if I don't keep an eye on her.


01:07:36.919 --> 01:07:40.522
She even changed her lock,


01:07:40.523 --> 01:07:45.126
and used my credit card like crazy.


01:07:45.127 --> 01:07:48.496
Credit card?


01:07:48.497 --> 01:07:52.500
I gave it to her for emergency.


01:07:52.501 --> 01:07:57.305
She used it so much that I tracked it down.


01:07:57.306 --> 01:08:01.299
And I kept seeing you.


01:08:12.822 --> 01:08:14.823
What the heck?


01:08:14.824 --> 01:08:17.525
This is Eun-hye's room.


01:08:17.526 --> 01:08:19.727
What the heck's going on?


01:08:19.728 --> 01:08:23.687
How is this...


01:08:50.226 --> 01:08:53.389
<i>What the...</i>


01:10:10.606 --> 01:10:12.801
Who are you?


01:10:54.016 --> 01:10:55.617
Pyung-hwa, open the door.


01:10:55.618 --> 01:10:59.821
Please honey, open! Pyung-hwa...


01:10:59.822 --> 01:11:03.815
Please! You know me!


01:12:12.428 --> 01:12:16.097
Sweetie, where's your mom?


01:12:16.098 --> 01:12:19.300
She went to work.


01:12:19.301 --> 01:12:21.201
"Demolition Notice"


01:12:27.810 --> 01:12:30.611
Are you moving as well?


01:12:30.612 --> 01:12:35.416
Yeah, she said we're
moving to a safer place.


01:12:35.417 --> 01:12:36.617
Is the new house decided?


01:12:36.618 --> 01:12:39.721
Yeah. Mom said it's really cool.


01:12:39.722 --> 01:12:43.715
So much better than our old houses.


01:12:47.296 --> 01:12:50.197
My cell phone.


01:12:54.903 --> 01:13:00.508
I have to call the police
and report that man.


01:13:00.509 --> 01:13:06.013
This is mine, right?


01:13:06.014 --> 01:13:10.017
My daughter gave me that as a present.


01:13:10.018 --> 01:13:12.919
Give it back, please.


01:13:17.726 --> 01:13:21.295
Mine! It's mine! Don't take it from me!


01:13:21.296 --> 01:13:24.699
It's mine! Give it back!


01:13:24.700 --> 01:13:27.100
Okay, fine...


01:13:29.605 --> 01:13:31.095
Here.


01:13:38.013 --> 01:13:42.006
Sweetie, could I use your phone?


01:14:08.310 --> 01:14:11.212
Pyung-hwa...


01:14:11.213 --> 01:14:14.115
are those...


01:14:14.116 --> 01:14:17.608
Yeah, they're all mine.


01:14:19.421 --> 01:14:22.322
Here.


01:14:30.599 --> 01:14:32.400
Pyung-hwa.


01:14:32.401 --> 01:14:33.601
Yeah?


01:14:33.602 --> 01:14:39.207
Where did you get this?


01:14:39.208 --> 01:14:41.809
<i>That's mom's.</i>


01:14:41.810 --> 01:14:45.803
What?


01:14:50.519 --> 01:14:54.522
This is our new house, cool, isn't it?


01:14:54.523 --> 01:15:02.523
I don't like carrots...


01:15:03.799 --> 01:15:07.792
But, I like mom...


01:15:41.303 --> 01:15:45.907
Please get him to stop peeping at my child.


01:15:45.908 --> 01:15:49.010
I can't sleep at night because of him.


01:15:49.011 --> 01:15:52.813
He's driving me crazy...


01:15:52.814 --> 01:15:55.616
Sung-chul.


01:15:55.617 --> 01:15:57.414
<i>It's mom.</i>


01:16:12.200 --> 01:16:15.703
It looks like someone lived
here after his death.


01:16:15.704 --> 01:16:19.106
Probably a homeless. I
feel bad for the deceased.


01:16:19.107 --> 01:16:23.100
Are we moving again?


01:16:30.419 --> 01:16:33.718
Who...


01:16:42.798 --> 01:16:46.500
Come out! Open this god darn door!


01:16:46.501 --> 01:16:50.805
You scumbag! You thought
I wouldn't find out?


01:16:50.806 --> 01:16:54.108
Too bad for you, I recorded everything!


01:16:54.109 --> 01:16:58.112
I'm gonna call the cops,
you're finished now!


01:16:58.113 --> 01:17:02.917
No, this is my house.


01:17:02.918 --> 01:17:05.318
This is my house.


01:17:10.525 --> 01:17:14.484
You're finished!


01:17:18.400 --> 01:17:21.494
Mom, it's mine, right?


01:17:22.504 --> 01:17:24.505
Pack your things, honey.


01:17:24.506 --> 01:17:28.203
We're moving to a much better house.


01:17:32.314 --> 01:17:34.215
Yeah.


01:17:34.216 --> 01:17:38.119
I'll send the kids first, so
please take care of them.


01:17:38.120 --> 01:17:40.421
Mom, we're really going back?


01:17:40.422 --> 01:17:42.623
We are, pack your toys.


01:17:42.624 --> 01:17:44.525
I'll have to convince him,


01:17:44.526 --> 01:17:48.485
or I'll just fly out by myself.


01:17:50.899 --> 01:17:53.800
"Serena Mart, credit card used 12,000 won"


01:18:06.114 --> 01:18:08.616
Don't do that, I haven't paid for it yet.


01:18:08.617 --> 01:18:11.519
It's all right, is it good?


01:18:11.520 --> 01:18:13.921
Yes, it's delicious.


01:18:13.922 --> 01:18:15.723
Mom, I want chocolate.


01:18:15.724 --> 01:18:19.226
Okay, hurry now.


01:18:19.227 --> 01:18:21.593
Her pronunciation is wonderful.


01:18:22.998 --> 01:18:26.400
There're no big markets nearby?


01:18:26.401 --> 01:18:27.601
No.


01:18:27.602 --> 01:18:30.705
"Min-ji"


01:18:30.706 --> 01:18:32.006
That's a pity.


01:18:32.007 --> 01:18:34.909
Mom, do we have to go now?


01:18:34.910 --> 01:18:36.711
Don't.
It's cold out.


01:18:36.712 --> 01:18:38.813
I said don't.
Ho-seh, stop it.


01:18:38.814 --> 01:18:40.915
Mom, hold on.


01:18:40.916 --> 01:18:44.318
Mom, my head really hurts.


01:18:44.319 --> 01:18:46.420
I got your medicine.


01:18:46.421 --> 01:18:49.219
Let's take the staircase instead.


01:18:51.326 --> 01:18:53.127
Mom, scold Ho-seh.


01:18:53.128 --> 01:18:57.087
Okay, honey, I will. Ho-seh, stop.


01:18:57.299 --> 01:18:58.899
You should talk to the manager.


01:18:58.900 --> 01:19:00.401
It's really strange.


01:19:00.402 --> 01:19:03.604
I can't contact him, it's been a week now.


01:19:03.605 --> 01:19:06.107
<i>Madam, it's...
Let me just</i> check.


01:19:06.108 --> 01:19:10.911
Please, let me peep inside.


01:19:10.912 --> 01:19:14.315
Mister, can't you see? I'm busy.


01:19:14.316 --> 01:19:16.517
You can't stop me every time.


01:19:16.518 --> 01:19:19.620
But you can't just ignore our protocol.


01:19:19.621 --> 01:19:21.622
When did I do that?


01:19:21.623 --> 01:19:23.924
The last time...
Pyung-hwa.


01:19:23.925 --> 01:19:26.994
Come along.


01:19:26.995 --> 01:19:30.898
Hey! You don't have to be a prick about it.


01:19:30.899 --> 01:19:32.900
Do you think I like doing this?


01:19:32.901 --> 01:19:36.003
Mom, that dog's so cute!


01:19:36.004 --> 01:19:38.305
Yeah? Should we get one too?


01:19:38.306 --> 01:19:40.908
Really? Can we get a puppy?


01:19:40.909 --> 01:19:43.911
It's cold, let's go inside.


01:19:43.912 --> 01:19:46.514
Should we get pizza for dinner?


01:19:46.515 --> 01:19:49.609
Pizza...


01:20:05.100 --> 01:20:09.093
Mom, she's weird.


01:20:10.005 --> 01:20:12.200
Su-ah.


01:20:14.009 --> 01:20:17.410
She's burning up.


01:20:27.622 --> 01:20:30.724
Ho-seh, I'll be right back.


01:20:30.725 --> 01:20:34.684
Lock the doors, and stay put, okay?


01:21:31.720 --> 01:21:35.713
I'm sorry, Sung-chul.


01:22:41.923 --> 01:22:44.325
Min-ii, are you okay?


01:22:44.326 --> 01:22:47.494
Is that you? What's going on?


01:22:47.495 --> 01:22:48.996
I've been calling you.


01:22:48.997 --> 01:22:52.990
Listen to me carefully.


01:22:54.202 --> 01:22:55.602
It's her.


01:22:55.603 --> 01:22:56.704
Who?


01:22:56.705 --> 01:22:59.707
That woman we saw at my
brother's apartment.


01:22:59.708 --> 01:23:01.108
What about her?


01:23:01.109 --> 01:23:03.310
She killed him.


01:23:03.311 --> 01:23:04.611
What?


01:23:04.612 --> 01:23:07.614
She killed my brother.


01:23:07.615 --> 01:23:10.617
She took everything,


01:23:10.618 --> 01:23:15.419
my wallet, card key, and my cell phone.


01:23:18.026 --> 01:23:20.894
Where're the kids?


01:23:20.895 --> 01:23:23.397
They're with me.


01:23:23.398 --> 01:23:28.202
Good, call the police,
I'll come right away.


01:23:28.203 --> 01:23:32.196
But leave the house immediately, okay?


01:24:33.201 --> 01:24:37.194
Pyung-hwa! Come out now.


01:24:43.211 --> 01:24:47.204
Mom, closet's huge!


01:24:49.417 --> 01:24:51.418
Yes?
Don't forget tomorrow's community meeting.


01:24:51.419 --> 01:24:54.121
Of course, see you then.


01:24:54.122 --> 01:24:56.818
Bye!


01:25:09.804 --> 01:25:13.797
Ho-seh, why isn't mom back?


01:25:17.812 --> 01:25:21.805
Should I call her?


01:25:31.126 --> 01:25:37.898
Mom, where are you? Su-ah woke up.


01:25:37.899 --> 01:25:41.892
Hurry back.


01:26:13.501 --> 01:26:18.906
Hey kids, you must be Ho-seh and Su-ah.


01:26:18.907 --> 01:26:20.704
Remember me?


01:26:23.711 --> 01:26:28.015
I guess not.


01:26:28.016 --> 01:26:31.218
Your mom had to go take care of something,


01:26:31.219 --> 01:26:34.621
she asked me to look after you two.


01:26:34.622 --> 01:26:35.822
What?


01:26:35.823 --> 01:26:40.894
She'll be back soon, so
let's wait at my house.


01:26:40.895 --> 01:26:43.489
Come on.


01:26:46.000 --> 01:26:48.802
Won't you open?


01:26:48.803 --> 01:26:53.797
Madam, that's my mom's coat.


01:26:58.313 --> 01:27:01.014
What are you saying?


01:27:01.015 --> 01:27:03.417
Where did you get it?


01:27:03.418 --> 01:27:06.420
Did mom give it to you?


01:27:06.421 --> 01:27:10.324
This coat is mine, it's mine.


01:27:10.325 --> 01:27:14.695
Where is my mom?


01:27:14.696 --> 01:27:18.689
Open this door, and talk.


01:27:19.701 --> 01:27:21.802
Open the door.


01:27:21.803 --> 01:27:24.004
Open it!


01:27:24.005 --> 01:27:25.706
Just look at this!
Are you nuts?


01:27:25.707 --> 01:27:27.908
What?
Nuts!


01:27:27.909 --> 01:27:31.411
I got you, I'm gonna get the cops.


01:27:31.412 --> 01:27:33.312
<i>Cops what...</i>


01:27:40.722 --> 01:27:44.224
Come on kids! Why are you in my car?


01:27:44.225 --> 01:27:49.096
Come on!
No, this is our car!


01:27:49.097 --> 01:27:53.500
You kids got it all wrong, this is my car.


01:28:10.018 --> 01:28:12.819
Come here!


01:28:12.820 --> 01:28:15.311
Go!


01:28:36.411 --> 01:28:38.812
He'll us!


01:28:38.813 --> 01:28:42.215
Please!


01:28:42.216 --> 01:28:47.521
Mom! Someone help!


01:28:47.522 --> 01:28:49.114
Dad!


01:29:18.920 --> 01:29:21.115
Let's go!


01:30:14.308 --> 01:30:17.402
Open this door!


01:30:54.916 --> 01:30:58.909
<i>Mom...</i>


01:31:10.097 --> 01:31:13.589
Dad!


01:32:03.317 --> 01:32:07.120
Min-ii...


01:32:07.121 --> 01:32:11.114
Mom!


01:32:11.926 --> 01:32:13.894
You Okay?


01:32:13.895 --> 01:32:17.888
<i>Mom...</i>


01:33:32.306 --> 01:33:36.299
No!


01:34:15.016 --> 01:34:19.009
Ho-seh.


01:34:49.617 --> 01:34:53.610
Children! Come out here.


01:34:54.722 --> 01:34:58.425
Now! Right this second!


01:34:58.426 --> 01:35:02.385
I'm so sick of this!


01:35:07.601 --> 01:35:12.806
Seriously! They're all smashed.


01:35:12.807 --> 01:35:16.299
I can't use these anymore.


01:35:18.112 --> 01:35:20.113
Look at that!


01:35:20.114 --> 01:35:24.107
You rascals mined my beautiful home!


01:35:33.994 --> 01:35:37.987
It's my home from now on.
No one can touch anything.


01:35:39.400 --> 01:35:43.903
I gotta buy new knickknacks,
and paint the walls too.


01:35:43.904 --> 01:35:49.001
Expand the sink a bit.
A new set of sofa too.


01:36:38.826 --> 01:36:41.590
Slop!


01:36:44.799 --> 01:36:49.002
Drop that, please drop it.


01:36:49.003 --> 01:36:51.404
This is my home! You hear me?


01:36:51.405 --> 01:36:58.211
I hear you, we'll leave, you can live here.


01:36:58.212 --> 01:37:05.311
Just let my family leave,
and it's all yours.


01:37:07.321 --> 01:37:08.721
Don't lie!


01:37:08.722 --> 01:37:09.923
I'm gonna burn everything.


01:37:09.924 --> 01:37:13.883
No, don't...


01:37:15.896 --> 01:37:19.889
Just let my family go.


01:37:26.006 --> 01:37:28.804
I'm not lying to you.


01:37:35.916 --> 01:37:43.916
This home, you can have it,
we'll leave peacefully.


01:37:52.499 --> 01:37:54.694
Police!


01:38:07.615 --> 01:38:11.608
Die! Just die!


01:38:15.322 --> 01:38:19.315
<i>It's mine, my home!</i>


01:38:20.394 --> 01:38:24.387
No! It's ours! Stop it!


01:38:25.799 --> 01:38:26.799
<i>It's my home!</i>


01:38:26.800 --> 01:38:28.801
No, it's not!


01:38:28.802 --> 01:38:33.106
Mine! It's mine!


01:38:33.107 --> 01:38:37.010
Why are you doing this to me?
What did I do?


01:38:37.011 --> 01:38:41.004
What did my daughter do to you?


01:38:47.521 --> 01:38:49.422
No...


01:38:49.423 --> 01:38:53.382
Not this house! Please, no!


01:38:58.699 --> 01:39:02.302
No!


01:39:02.303 --> 01:39:06.296
Please! No! Help!


01:39:09.410 --> 01:39:13.403
No...


01:39:21.722 --> 01:39:25.715
My house...


01:40:06.500 --> 01:40:10.493
Mom!


01:40:20.214 --> 01:40:22.115
Mom!


01:40:22.116 --> 01:40:25.218
Min-ii! Wake up! Min-ji!


01:40:25.219 --> 01:40:29.212
<i>Honey, wake up!</i>


01:41:02.222 --> 01:41:07.285
<i>“Rest in Peace, Baek Sung-chul“</i>


01:41:22.009 --> 01:41:25.611
We'll arrive at 11 A.M.


01:41:25.612 --> 01:41:29.515
Yeah, local time.


01:41:29.516 --> 01:41:34.120
Mom, we're leaving now.


01:41:34.121 --> 01:41:39.320
You sure it's safe there?


01:41:51.105 --> 01:41:53.806
This place was a bargain.


01:41:53.807 --> 01:41:57.009
It's okay, the neighborhood
seems pretty good.


01:41:57.010 --> 01:42:00.012
Yeah, you know.


01:42:00.013 --> 01:42:01.914
Stop running around, settle down!


01:42:01.915 --> 01:42:05.017
In the living room please.
Yes, madam.


01:42:05.018 --> 01:42:07.420
Yeah, of course.


01:42:07.421 --> 01:42:11.414
Honey! I told you not to go up there.


01:42:13.794 --> 01:42:17.787
It's so much better than
where we lived before.


01:42:27.708 --> 01:42:30.510
There's a weird rumor


01:42:30.511 --> 01:42:34.814
going around in my neighborhood.


01:42:34.815 --> 01:42:36.916
It's about squatters
hiding in others' homes,


01:42:36.917 --> 01:42:42.321
and secretly living there.


01:42:42.322 --> 01:42:49.395
And they settle down and
take the owner's place.


01:42:49.396 --> 01:42:53.389
Just like baby owls.

